== Done: build-switch-all/ssrecomp.nro (30M)

On the Switch's SD card, make the folder /switch/ssrecomp/ and copy into it:
  - build-switch-all/ssrecomp.nro
  - your ROM, renamed to rom.nds
Then hold R while starting any game, and choose ssrecomp in the Homebrew Menu.
The save (soulsilver.sav), settings (ssrecomp.cfg) and game.log are written to that folder.
zip holds: switch/pokemon-ds-wide/pokemon-ds-wide.nro, switch/pokemon-ds-wide/LICENSE.txt, switch/pokemon-ds-wide/LICENSE-Noto.txt, switch/pokemon-ds-wide/LICENSE-mGBA.txt, switch/pokemon-ds-wide/roms/
